                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Eleventh Meeting of the Working Group Participating
                        in the Washington Exploratory Talks on Security, August</hi> 16, 1948</p>
                <p>The eleventh meeting was devoted to discussion of the points to be covered by a
                    drafting party in its preparation of a statement on “The Nature of North
                    American Association with a North Atlantic Security Arrangement.” The unsigned
                    memorandum of this meeting is not printed (840.20/8–1648).</p>
            </div>
        </body>
